    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Diversified experience: Can be hung up or hung up, supports seamless switching between offline and online, and allows you to play Three Kingdoms anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Easy Placement: The perfect combination of automatic combat and internal affairs management frees hands to enjoy the fun of strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Deep cultivation: Collect 100+generals freely, and each general has:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Unique personality and growth curve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Exclusive combo skills and bond bonuses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Multidimensional cultivation system (star promotion/breakthrough/skills/formation)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Sandbox exploration:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Free exploration of famous cities in the Three Kingdoms, uncovering hidden treasures/mounts/skill books</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Special architectural Easter eggs (such as Bronze Sparrow Terrace where rare generals can be encountered)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Strategy first:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--The combination of generals affects battlefield efficiency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Internal policy decisions change the development of power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Multi threaded growth path to create exclusive legion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Diversified experience: Can be hung up or hung up, supports seamless switching between offline and online, and allows you to play Three Kingdoms anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Easy Placement: The perfect combination of automatic combat and internal affairs management frees hands to enjoy the fun of strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Deep cultivation: Collect 100+generals freely, and each general has:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Unique personality and growth curve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Exclusive combo skills and bond bonuses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Multidimensional cultivation system (star promotion/breakthrough/skills/formation)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Sandbox exploration:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Free exploration of famous cities in the Three Kingdoms, uncovering hidden treasures/mounts/skill books</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Special architectural Easter eggs (such as Bronze Sparrow Terrace where rare generals can be encountered)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Strategy first:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--The combination of generals affects battlefield efficiency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Internal policy decisions change the development of power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Multi threaded growth path to create exclusive legion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
